      <h3><a href="https://brewingagile.org/">Brewing Agile</a> <time>2012–2018</time></h3>
      <p class="row-summary">I founded Brewing Agile in 2012. It grew out of the Scrum Beers crowd into a Göteborg conference about agile thinking, learning, leadership, collaboration, and process — less about selling a method, more about making space for practice and debate.</p>
