  <li class="row">
    <div class="row-main">
      <h3><a href="https://www.meetup.com/scrum-beers-goteborg/">Scrum Beers Göteborg</a> <time>Meetup</time></h3>
      <p class="row-summary">The low-ceremony version of an agile meetup: people in a pub, talking about teams, delivery, collaboration, architecture, leadership, and whatever is currently making work harder than it needs to be.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="row-pitch">Deliberately relaxed: people comparing notes over a beer. Sometimes a theme; the side conversations often carry the evening.</p>
